	bool "Auto-start ai_agent task at boot"
	default y
	---help---
		Spawn ai_agent --daemon in a background task so heartbeat/cron
		(e.g. daily report, pending alarm pickup) run without manual
		"ai_agent &". With VG_HMI_AUTOSTART on, the agent starts after
		the HMI task with a 3s settle delay. NSH remains on the console
		thread; "ai_agent" without --daemon attaches an interactive CLI.

